      <h2 id="services-heading">What we do</h2>
      <p>Every job starts with proper prep and finishes to spec. No shortcuts.</p>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <article class="service-card rv">
          <h3>Concrete driveways & crossovers</h3>
          <p>Formed, poured, and finished to handle daily traffic. Broom or exposed aggregate finish.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card rv">
          <h3>Slabs & patios</h3>
          <p>House slabs, shed floors, alfresco areas, basketball courts - level, reinforced, cured right.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card rv">
          <h3>Registered building work</h3>
          <p>BLD 278399. All structural concrete meets code. Paperwork handled.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="service-card rv">
          <h3>Excavation & tipping</h3>
          <p>Site cuts, trench works, removal and disposal. We move the dirt so the concrete sits clean.</p>
        </article>
